===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Ursaring|139}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*'''Claw Slash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Sableye|92}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
